中概述sGC激动剂类效应（如低血压、头痛）及相应监测要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_61_ib_risk","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","风险管控计划"],"target":"6.1节末段：SGC-R22已知风险与管控措施"}],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）中SGC-R22药理机制与非临床安全性数据","试验用药品风险管控计划（RMP）或已知类效应风险清单"],"proposal_text":"本研究试验用药品为SMOKE-r2-2口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R22），属小分子化合物，以口服固体制剂形式给药，产生全身性暴露。试验干预包括SGC-R22低剂量（2.5mg每日一次）和SGC-R22高剂量（5mg每日一次）两个活性剂量组，以及外观与给药频次一致的口服安慰剂片（每日一次）作为对照。三组均连续给药12周，采用1:1:1平行随机分配。研究时期由筛选期（最长14天）、双盲治疗期（12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）组成。SGC-R22的完整药理作用机制、非临床安全性特征、已知类效应风险及相应风险管控措施详见研究者手册。","rationale":"药物名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、暴露范围（systemic）、剂量（2.5mg/5mg QD）、治疗周期（12周）、安慰剂描述（外观与频次一致）、随机比例（1:1:1）及研究时期划分均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。SGC-R22的完整非临床数据、已知风险及风险管控措施需依据研究者手册由医学负责人确认后补充。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_fe1c497771c5_16f265b0e2ad7bf5","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c1b6fdd77a3511143084c1cc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36c8fd703b73e4"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001034551_dd1346fe","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"试验药物：SMOKE-r2-2口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R22）","quote_sha256":"314fa493e57ba405b3e7ada30b0334f3c0db10e500a708d710bd97bab4900e24","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"es_drug_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"es_tech_type"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r2-2口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R22）：SMOKE-r2-2片：低剂量组2.5mg、高剂量组5mg，口服每日一次，连续12周","quote_sha256":"fbabc70f53f173211cc1f4cd8610bd00cfa490fd4ca322c7aae7962d0d8de3c6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"es_dosing_scheme"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂口服片每日一次，外观与频次一致，治疗12周；1:1:1平行随机","quote_sha256":"94521fff9b92875cfd631e3e69f92ff64f4572d9c2b85c52a955412a6a7c3847","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"es_placebo_desc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索设计","quote_sha256":"6b541f609b7dbe55eeebdf04f2def91dbe2a8f33b58d692f3d04a9bb87b739cf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"es_blind_design"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_drug_identity","es_tech_type","es_dosing_scheme","es_placebo_desc","es_blind_design"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"待研究者手册定稿后补充sGC激动机制、受体选择性、非临床毒理学及既往人体安全性数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_mechanism","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床研究报告","既往临床研究摘要"],"target":"6.1.1节：SGC-R22作用机制与非临床数据"},{"action":"由医学负责人依据IB确认sGC激动剂类效应风险及方案中需体现的监测要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_risk","missing_source_classes":["风险管控计划","IB安全性章节"],"target":"6.1.1节：已知风险与风险管控"}],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）中SGC-R22药理机制、受体结合数据与非临床安全性数据","既往人体研究（I期或海外II期）安全性与有效性摘要","sGC激动剂类效应风险清单（如低血压、头痛、视觉障碍）"],"proposal_text":"SMOKE-r2-2（SGC-R22）为口服可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶（sGC）激动剂，属小分子化合物，通过口服途径给药后产生全身性暴露。本品在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上用于中重度慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）成人受试者的概念验证与剂量探索。本研究设置SGC-R22低剂量（2.5mg每日一次）和高剂量（5mg每日一次）两个活性组，以外观与给药频次一致的口服安慰剂片为对照，三组均连续给药12周。SGC-R22的具体作用机制、受体结合特征、非临床药理学与毒理学数据、既往人体研究结果及已知安全性风险详见研究者手册，本章节仅概述药物类别与本研究中的给药方案。","rationale":"药物类别（sGC激动剂）、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、暴露范围（systemic）、适应症（HFrEF）、研究目的（PoC与剂量探索）、剂量方案（2.5mg/5mg QD×12周）及安慰剂描述均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。SGC-R22的完整作用机制、非临床安全性数据、已知类效应风险及风险管控措施需依据研究者手册由医学负责人确认后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_fe1c497771c5_f9ef9b6865bafbbd","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c1b6fdd77a3511143084c1cc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36c8fd703b73e4"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001034551_dd1346fe","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"需药学部门与药物管理部门提供SGC-R22及安慰剂的包装规格、标签模板、储存条件及有效期管理要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_612_packaging","missing_source_classes":["药物包装规格文件","标签模板","储存条件文件"],"target":"6.1.2节：制备、包装、标签、储存与管理"},{"action":"需确认研究中心药物储存条件（温度监控、专柜保管）、接收验收流程及偏差处理程序","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_612_storage","missing_source_classes":["研究中心药物管理SOP","药物接收验收流程"],"target":"6.1.2节：研究中心储存管理"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品制备与包装规格文件","药物标签模板（含盲法标识要求）","储存温度与条件要求（如2-8°C或室温）","运输与接收验收流程文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需描述SGC-R22及安慰剂的制备工艺、包装形式与规格、标签内容（含盲法标识）、储存温度与条件、有效期管理、运输与接收验收流程、研究中心储存管理要求等。当前允许来源中无本项目对应的药物管理手册、包装规格说明、标签模板或储存条件文件。公司语料中关于IMP储存与发放的描述来自其他适应症（特应性皮炎、I期）方案，仅可作为章节结构参照，不可迁移为本项目SGC-R22的实施规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_fe1c497771c5_d49f37c7bd93fa97","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c1b6fdd77a3511143084c1cc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36c8fd703b73e4"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001034551_dd1346fe","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认IWRS/IRT系统类型、药物编号规则、发放触发条件及记录方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_613_distribution","missing_source_classes":["IWRS系统说明","药物发放SOP"],"target":"6.1.3节：发放流程"},{"action":"需确认空包装回收要求、未使用药物返还流程、监查清点频率及偏差处理程序","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_613_return","missing_source_classes":["药物回收SOP","监查清点流程","药品销毁流程"],"target":"6.1.3节：回收与清点"}],"heading":"发放、回收与清点","missing_source_classes":["IWRS/IRT系统操作说明与药物编号规则","药物发放与回收记录模板","药物清点SOP（含清点频率与偏差处理）","药品返还与销毁流程文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需描述试验用药品的发放流程（含IWRS/IRT系统操作）、回收要求（含空包装与未使用药物）、清点频率与记录方式、药品返还与销毁流程、偏差与丢失处理程序等。当前允许来源中无本项目对应的药物发放回收规范、IWRS系统说明或药物清点SOP。公司语料中关于IMP发放回收与清点的描述来自其他适应症方案，仅可作为章节结构参照，不可迁移为本项目SGC-R22的实施规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_fe1c497771c5_f96c26c33880d3b3","section_number":"6.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c1b6fdd77a3511143084c1cc","c